1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,320
The story of Arthur the Rat. Once upon a time there was a young rat who couldn't

2
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:11,199
make up his mind. Whenever the other rats asked him if he would like to come out

3
00:00:11,199 --> 00:00:17,239
hunting with them, he would answer in a hoarse voice, I don't know. And when they

4
00:00:17,239 --> 00:00:21,479
said, would you rather stay...

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:29,279
inside, he would say yes or no either. He'd always shake making a choice.

6
00:00:29,279 --> 00:00:34,680
One fine day his Aunt Josephine said to him, now look here, no one will ever care for you

7
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:39,760
if you carry on like this. You have no more mind of your own than a greasy old blade of

8
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:40,000
grass.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The young rat coughed and looked quiet as usual, but said nothing.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Don't you think so, said his aunt, stamping her foot,

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
for she couldn't bear to see the young rat so cold-blooded.

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
I don't know was all he ever answered.

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
And then he walked off to think.

